{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_07CA30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"为了首次宇宙飞行，我们开始了日复一日的训练。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"The Boss熬过了严酷的训练，而我一直从旁协助。那是一段幸福的日子。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"然后到了4月12日。载着她的飞船飞出了大气层。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"虽然只是20分钟的弹道飞行，但考虑到准备时间如此短，已经可以称得上奇迹。人类首次宇宙飞行。我们欣喜若狂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":152,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"然而，悲剧发生在返航途中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"再入时外壳发生变形，进入角度也出现了轻微偏差。原因显然就是那扇仓促加装的舷窗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"载着她的飞船远远偏离预定地点，落入海中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我们怀着祈祷般的心情赶往落水地点，耳边却一直回响着收音机里的新闻。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"那是Vostok火箭发射成功的消息。宇航员是Yuri Gagarin。我们只差一步，却还是被苏联抢先了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"等我们赶到时，飞船已经沉入海中。The Boss漂浮在海面上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"之后发生的事，我已经记不太清了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"后来听说，我发出了一声奇怪的尖叫，随后跳进海里，甚至顾不上阳光会灼伤皮肤。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"她一直没有醒来。全身挫伤、烧伤、宇宙射线辐射。她还能活着，本身就是奇迹。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"苏联每天都在不断播送炫耀这一辉煌成果的宣传。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"最让我们难以忍受的，是第二天早上<R=政府机关报,IZVESTIA>刊登的报道。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=政府机关报,IZVESTIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"报道中写着后来据说由Gagarin少校说出的那句话：“地球是蓝色的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"而另一个本该说出这句话的人，此刻却仍躺在病床上……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"NASA把她的那次飞行彻底当成了“从未发生过”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"一边是进入卫星轨道、绕地球一周，飞行员还平安归来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"另一边却只是沿弹道轨迹飞出大气层，飞行员遍体鳞伤，连飞船都没能回收……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"高层判断，一旦贸然公布，就会伤及国家威信。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"军方记录似乎把这段时期的The Boss写成了正在参加猪湾事件。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"看来他们就是想把这段记录彻底掩盖过去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"最终，一个月后Alan Shepard的弹道飞行被认定为美国首次宇宙飞行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"The Boss用牺牲换来的经验被应用在Shepard的飞船上。这才有了那次成功。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"可那些对我来说都无所谓。我只是一心祈祷她能够康复，一刻也不想离开她身边。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"“给我水。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"夏天已经结束、冬天将至的时候，我终于再次听见了她的声音。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"我扑进她怀里。她也接纳了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"那样就足够了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"我原以为她会给我讲太空，讲那片星星不会闪烁的真正天空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"可她说出口的却全是地球。她从宇宙中看到的地球，那片脆弱却又无可替代的大地。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":32,"cn_text":"我感到羞愧。我只顾憧憬星空，却从未想过低头看看脚下，看看支撑着自己的这片大地。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":33,"cn_text":"康复训练刚结束，她就消失了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":34,"cn_text":"一切来得突然。她没有联系我，高层也没有给出任何解释。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":35,"cn_text":"奇怪的是，我并不惊讶。我想，她大概是去完成下一个任务了。为了尽忠。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":36,"cn_text":"从那以后，我便埋头研究<R=人工智能,AI>。为了不再出现像她那样的牺牲者。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=人工智能,AI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":37,"cn_text":"明知任务危险，就没必要非得让人类去完成。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":38,"cn_text":"下一次，要由我去照亮另一个人……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":39,"cn_text":"我至今仍在想，那个佛罗里达的夜晚，她为什么会对我说出那些事。即使已经过去，那也应该是绝密行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":40,"cn_text":"我愿意相信是因为她信任我……但恐怕并不是。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":41,"cn_text":"她只是想让某个人听见。而那个人，并不是我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":42,"cn_text":"她那像在对自己孩子说话般的语气，还有遥望远方的目光，都清楚地说明了这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":43,"cn_text":"我嫉妒起了那个“某个人”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":44,"cn_text":"四年后，我得知了她的死讯，而且还是以“卖国贼之死”这样的形式。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":45,"cn_text":"听说她从<R=祖国,AMERICA>带走核武器，叛逃苏联，最后被昔日的弟子杀死……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=祖国,AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":46,"cn_text":"我无法相信。她绝不可能做出那种事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":47,"cn_text":"如果一定要解释，要么她是真的想促成东西方和解……要么，被杀本身就是她的愿望。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":48,"cn_text":"她认为这个世界并非本来的模样——这个依靠核威慑维持虚假和平的世界。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":49,"cn_text":"而且，她认为造成这一切的责任也在自己……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"也许她是想用死亡来赎罪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"她尽到了对这个世界的忠诚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":52,"cn_text":"我的光消失了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":53,"cn_text":"而现在，我却被自己这种极端不合逻辑的感情弄得不知所措。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":54,"cn_text":"那个她想倾诉自己罪孽的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":55,"cn_text":"会不会，就是那个最终杀死她的弟子？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":56,"cn_text":"这个想法让我嫉妒得几乎发狂。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":57,"cn_text":"总有一天，我必须确认真相。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""}]}